    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d222">

                <pb facs="0240" n="166" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp02v01/pg166"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/6536</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Rumania</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Andrews</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Jassy</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-08-12">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 12, 1917</hi></date>. <lb/> [<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Received August 21, 2.45 a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Inform Department that I have received official information that the Ministry for
                    Foreign Affairs and Diplomatic Corps will leave towards the end of the week for
                    Kherson, Russia. This is merely a measure of precaution. It is expected that
                    most of the Government will remain at Jassy.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Andrews</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
